	(text "This is just the Numeric Pad from the \"full\"\nV364 Keyboard. It is planned that the V364\nrecreation motherboard will have an extra\nkeyboard connector for this keypad.\n\nThis is V1-R2 that uses a hybrid Switch footprint.\nCan use normal Cherry, or low-profile Gateron switches"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
